text = "The Basic Gatherer building is your source of gold, It can only be placed on darkend tiles. It will provide gold at the end of each wave. 

To collect the gold from the gatherer you must connect it to your central building with train tracks. Rotate with 'r' to change direction that cargo will be pushed along a track tile. Direct cargo from the Gatherer to the central building to gain gold. Cargo will be destroyed if it train track ahead is destroyed during enemy attack.

Build your defenses with towers and walls to prepare for enemy attack. Press 'start wave' when ready.

Select a building to upgrade, repair or sell it later."

